 "scoring": "Per arm & replicate: guide LFC = log2(RPM+1) end - log2(RPM+1) T0 (arm's own T0; pDNA for DeWeirdt), guides with <30 T0 reads or bottom-2% T0 dropped, gene LFC = mean over guides (>=2), median-centred. GI(q,g) = LFC_g(q-KO) - running median of LFC_KO over genes ordered by LFC_WT (window n/40); z = residual / running MAD (floored at global MAD-SD), re-standardised per screen. Per-replicate z (KO rep A vs WT rep A, B vs B) = gi_rep1/gi_rep2; pooled z from replicate-mean LFCs. Query's own library row dropped.",
 "label_rule": "positive: pooled z <= -4 AND z < 0 in both replicates AND median-centred LFC_KO < -0.5 (library gene actually depletes in the KO; removes masked WT growth gains such as TSC2/NF1/PTEN) AND gene not positive for >= 3 distinct queries (IER3IP1, MARK2, LARP7 removed). negative: |pooled z| < 1. else null. -4 rather than -3 because parental-vs-parental null screens reproduce 56% of the z<=-3 hit rate but 32% at z<=-4.",
